      "writtenOn": "2022-09-08T00:35:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you want to fix the bug this way, suggest instead of doing this, always hex it in toVpnProfile(), and un-hex it in fromVpnProfile()\n\nThe same format is used by some of the other open source implementations, thus the convolutedness of it.\n\nBut assuming someone sets the KeyIdIdentification, they probably assume they get the equivalvalent value out here as they would if they set the key ID as a string (see VpnIkev2Utils)",
